Human: Can you tell me the steps to write an if/then statement in C programming language?

Assistant: Sure! A simple example of an if/then statement is:

```
if (x > 0) {
  printf("\"%d\" is greater than 0.\n", x);
  else {
    printf("\"%d\" is less than or equal to 0.\n", x);
  }
}
else {
  printf("\"%d\" is lesser than or equal to 0.\n", x);
}

```
